Description: Design-aware workflows for generalized linear models, generalized
    linear mixed models, distributional regression, generalized additive models
    for location, scale and shape, vector generalized linear and additive models,
    ordinal and compositional responses, quantitative-treatment regression,
    diagnostics, post-hoc inference, prediction, visualization, simulation and
    reproducible reporting in agricultural experiments. The package preserves
    experimental-unit structure, routes models to compatible statistical engines,
    and records automated decisions in an auditable workflow rather than selecting
    models solely by significance tests or information criteria.
